The complete corresponding source of the LordOS Raspberry Pi 5 kernel package
linux-image-6.18.57-lordos.3-rpi-2712 6.18.57-3+lordos (source package linux-lordos-rpi-2712), GPL-2.0.
Revision 3 is the kernel of the LordOS Raspberry Pi images since 0.8.4 (lordos-<version>-rpi5-arm64.img.xz);
the files below are those of the package in lordos-0.8.8-rpi5-arm64.img.xz.

