Files (lordos.org/apt/pool/rpi/source/l/linux-lordos-rpi-2712/):

  linux-lordos-rpi-2712_6.18.57.orig.tar.gz
      Raspberry Pi's kernel tree at that commit, unmodified: GitHub's tarball of the commit
      (https://codeload.github.com/raspberrypi/linux/tar.gz/234188315037848e5b07d65b85d38edc64095caa),
      257630958 bytes, SHA-256 d56a9ef72764b5a9af7eb77ef9a5d3866a2b6068ec35700b43e1df0eb6a2fdf3.
      Uncompressed it is byte for byte the output of
          git archive --format=tar --prefix=linux-234188315037848e5b07d65b85d38edc64095caa/ 234188315037848e5b07d65b85d38edc64095caa
      (SHA-256 688210f7f8e4dc182404aee8717edf522b223292368477fa09e2b1fcf28a17e5, checked with git 2.47.3),
